### Route berechnen (Standardprofil aus application.yaml)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "start": {
    "latitude": 47.678,
    "longitude": 9.173
  },
  "destination": {
    "latitude": 47.566,
    "longitude": 10.700
  }
}

### Route mit explizitem BRouter-Profil berechnen
POST http://localhost:8081/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "start": {
    "latitude": 47.678,
    "longitude": 9.173
  },
  "destination": {
    "latitude": 47.566,
    "longitude": 10.700
  },
  "profile": "car-fast"
}

### Ungültige Koordinaten (erwartet HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "start": {
    "latitude": 120.0,
    "longitude": 9.173
  },
  "destination": {
    "latitude": 47.566,
    "longitude": 10.700
  }
}

### Fehlendes Ziel (erwartet HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "start": {
    "latitude": 47.678,
    "longitude": 9.173
  }
}
